# Generated MobileCLIP inference graphs and tokenizer vocabulary (~151 MB). Provisioned locally by
# tools/mobileclip/setup_assets.py. model.json and LICENSE_MODELS stay tracked, so the expected
# checkpoint hash and the upstream model licence live in the repository even though the weights do not.
